			"text": "你桌上有一份档案。",
			"next": "assistant_call_003b"
		},
		{
			"id": "assistant_call_003b",
			"speaker": "assistant",
			"text": "档案室刚才复核时发现，登记内容和现存材料对不上。",
			"next": "assistant_call_004"
